1
00:00:00,946 --> 00:00:03,946
(Leonard:)What did you mean when you said
you were going to miss me?

2
00:00:05,868 --> 00:00:10,328
(Leonard:)I don't know.
You'll be gone and I'll notice.

3
00:00:11,999 --> 00:00:16,089
Okay. Well, what about this?
What does this mean?

4
00:00:16,837 --> 00:00:21,587
Wine, a credit card and late-night
television are a bad combination?

5
00:00:23,094 --> 00:00:24,134
(Leonard:)All right, fine.

6
00:00:24,303 --> 00:00:27,513
(Leonard:)What about that really long hug?
What did that mean?

7
00:00:28,599 --> 00:00:30,019
(Penny:)That wasn't a long hug.

8
00:00:30,518 --> 00:00:34,148
(Leonard:)It was at least five Mississippis.

9
00:00:34,814 --> 00:00:39,654
(Leonard:)A standard hug
is two Mississippis, tops.

10
00:00:41,112 --> 00:00:44,112
(Penny:)Leonard, I don't know what to tell you.
It was just a hug.

11
00:00:45,157 --> 00:00:47,037
- Glad we cleared that up.
- Yeah.

12
00:00:47,201 --> 00:00:49,331
- I guess I'll see you.
- Okay.

13
00:00:49,495 --> 00:00:52,205
(Penny:)- Have a safe trip.
- Thank you.

14
00:00:52,540 --> 00:00:54,040
(Leonard:)- Bye.
- Okay, bye.

15
00:00:58,212 --> 00:00:59,382
[SIGHS]

16
00:00:59,547 --> 00:01:08,027
It means I wish you weren't going.

